---
import { page, asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Event Management" active="event-management">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Event management</span>

        <h1>Seamless <span>Events</span>. Lasting Impact</h1>

        <p>
          Professional event management designed to bring your ideas to life.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img
          src={asset('assets/images/10.event-management/hero.png')}
          alt="Professional promotional banner stands"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-content">
    <section>
      <h2>Event Management</h2>
      <p>Planning and delivering a successful event requires careful organisation, attention to detail and effective coordination. Whether you're hosting a conference, product launch, corporate event or internal or external presentation, Efexacademy can help you manage the process from initial planning through to the event itself.</p>

      <p>We understand that every event has its own objectives, challenges and requirements. That's why we take a tailored approach, working closely with you to understand your vision and ensure that the important details are considered. From coordinating schedules and managing arrangements to keeping everything on track, our aim is to make the entire experience as straightforward and stress-free as possible.</p>

      <p>You'll have a dedicated project manager who will act as your single point of contact throughout the process, providing clear communication, ongoing support and consistent coordination. This allows you to concentrate on your business, your guests and other priorities, while we focus on helping your event run smoothly and professionally.</p>
    </section>

     <section class="row image-content">
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/10.event-management/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
      </div>Planning and delivering a successful event requires careful organisation, attention to detail and effective coordination. Whether you're hosting a conference, product launch, corporate event or internal or external presentation, Efexacademy can help you manage the process from initial planning through to the event itself.

